        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Dungeon (W)Hoarders: A New Adventure Awaits</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfurl a new adventure with every click in <strong>Dungeon (W)Hoarders</strong>, a laid-back dungeon crawler inspired by classic tabletop quests. It’s the thrill of a grand saga combined with the satisfying simplicity of a mouse-clicker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a Living, Shifting Map</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide your <strong>legendary Hero!</strong> across a constantly shifting map made of unique hex tiles. Every single run is a new experience as the dungeon rearranges itself, offering endless replayability. Will you choose the path of least resistance or dare to venture toward a dangerous monster?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040980/extras/b3223dd560d643f09c543916884dca40.avif?t=1759849271\" alt=\"Dungeon Hex Map 50\" width=800 height=412 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face Challenges and Claim Your Hoard</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every tile you click on presents a new opportunity. You might reveal a formidable creature to battle, a chest overflowing with loot, or a coveted healing potion. Navigate strategically to find what you seek. Will you risk a confrontation with a <strong>powerful monster</strong> to uncover a useful <strong>treasure</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040980/extras/4e58de045f993c1d42b303561fb95e7f.avif?t=1759849271\" alt=\"Monster Fight!\" width=795 height=409 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040980/extras/868ba4b3a2ab826d2554b64851f4c0a9.avif?t=1759849271\" alt=\"Loot Discovered!\" width=797 height=412 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Roll of the Dice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are ever the same. Your journey is a fresh roll of the dice every time, with different enemies, treasures, and choices to make. The intuitive one-click gameplay lets you focus on your path, while the unpredictable nature of the dungeon ensures every adventure is a new story waiting to be told.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040980/extras/4030da58cfd9d7cd9ef462a2b17d12bc.avif?t=1759849271\" alt=\"Dungeon Floor Cleared\" width=799 height=413 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>How far will you go to be a Dungeon (W)Hoarder?</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
